ParentVault_withdrawFor
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the beneficiary is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
├── when the beneficiary is the ParentVault
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidBeneficiary
├── when the amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoZeroAmount
├── when the epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
└── when the withdraw is valid
    ├── it should transfer shares only from the payer
    ├── it should record the position and event for the beneficiary
    ├── it should update the epoch total and return its nonce
    └── only the beneficiary should cancel and receive the shares
